menu "reBuddy arm components"
    config REBUDDY_ARM_MONITOR
        bool "Start CAN1 in passive listen-only mode"
        default n
        help
            Receives existing RS status broadcasts at 1 Mbps. Sends no frames
            or ACKs and does not discover, configure or enable motors.
            Another active CAN node is needed to acknowledge broadcasts.
            Disabled by default: both transceivers remain in standby.
endmenu
